    "en": {
      "trackName": "Slalom Skiing",
      "description": "Carve down the mountain using the Apple Watch crown in this fast, cozy, endlessly replayable skiing game made just for Apple Watch. Each run lasts about a minute, making it perfect for quick breaks, waiting in line, waiting at the doctor’s office, or a short flight layoff or whenever you want a tiny burst of fun on the go.\nSteer through slalom gates, dodge cute bunnies and snowmen, and shake your wrist to trigger a playful snow‑globe effect that fills the screen with swirling flakes. Miss a gate and you’ll get a 5‑second penalty, so precision matters — but the runs are short enough that you’ll always want “just one more try.”\nDesigned from the ground up for watchOS, the game delivers instant‑start gameplay, crisp pixel‑style visuals, and satisfying haptics that make every turn feel tactile. Whether you’re chasing your fastest time or simply enjoying a quick moment of calm, this tiny ski hill fits right on your wrist.",
